\PYG{l+s+sd}{\PYGZdq{}\PYGZdq{}\PYGZdq{}}
\PYG{l+s+sd}{An example implementation of a real experiment, using Wigner Time timelines.}

\PYG{l+s+sd}{As well as providing conveniences, the functions can be used to document the intention and meaning of each stage.}
\PYG{l+s+sd}{\PYGZdq{}\PYGZdq{}\PYGZdq{}}

